> [2] https://mc-stan.org/
> [3] https://kenkellner.com/ubms/
> [4] https://kenkellner.com/blog/ubms-vignette.html
> [5] https://kenkellner.com/ubms/articles/JAGS-comparison.html
> [6] https://github.com/kenkellner/ubms/issues

